ion files (table fields). The layout slices (FP-0111 to FP-0115) would like it to also dump GSUB, GPOS, and GDEF subtable data as test expectations. It would never produce shaping output or run in the engine. Extend its approved use?","options":[{"label":"Extend","description":"Allow GSUB/GPOS/GDEF dumps as expectation files, recorded in engineering/dependencies.json."},{"label":"Keep current scope","description":"Layout expectations are derived first-party from the binary tables."}],"recommended":0}]}}
